## 2. Pull Request Analysis Flow (Sequence Diagram)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant API as API Server
    participant Queue as Redis Queue
    participant AW as Analyzer Worker
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant AFW as Autofix Worker
    participant LLM as LLM Service
    participant Email as Email Service

    Dev->>GH: Create/Update Pull Request
    GH->>API: Webhook Event (PR opened/synchronized)
    API->>API: Verify Webhook Signature
    API->>DB: Create PRRun Record
    API->>Queue: Enqueue Analysis Job
    API-->>GH: 200 OK (Acknowledge)
    
    Queue->>AW: Pick Analysis Job
    AW->>GH: Clone Repository
    AW->>AW: Detect Languages
    
    par Parallel Analysis
        AW->>AW: Run ESLint
        AW->>AW: Run Semgrep
        AW->>AW: Run Bandit
        AW->>AW: Run PMD
        AW->>AW: Run Security Scanners
    end
    
    AW->>DB: Save Findings
    AW->>GH: Post PR Comment (Summary)
    AW->>Email: Send Notification
    AW->>Queue: Enqueue Autofix Job (if enabled)
    
    Queue->>AFW: Pick Autofix Job
    AFW->>DB: Fetch Findings
    AFW->>LLM: Request Code Fixes
    
    alt LLM Provider Selection
        LLM->>LLM: Try Groq (Primary)
        LLM->>LLM: Fallback to Gemini
        LLM->>LLM: Fallback to OpenAI
    end
    
    LLM-->>AFW: Return Fixed Code
    AFW->>AFW: Validate Syntax
    AFW->>GH: Create Fix Branch
    AFW->>GH: Commit Changes
    AFW->>GH: Create PR with Fixes
    AFW->>DB: Update Status
    AFW->>Email: Notify User
    
    Email-->>Dev: Email Notification
```

---

## 3. User Authentication & Authorization Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant UI as UI Service
    participant Auth as Passport Auth
    participant GH as GitHub OAuth
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Session as Session Store

    User->>UI: Click "Login with GitHub"
    UI->>Auth: Initiate OAuth Flow
    Auth->>GH: Redirect to GitHub OAuth
    GH-->>User: Show Authorization Page
    User->>GH: Approve Access
    GH->>Auth: Callback with Code
    Auth->>GH: Exchange Code for Token
    GH-->>Auth: Access Token
    Auth->>GH: Fetch User Profile
    GH-->>Auth: User Data
    Auth->>DB: Find/Create User
    DB-->>Auth: User Record
    Auth->>Session: Create Session
    Auth-->>UI: Redirect to Dashboard
    UI-->>User: Show Dashboard
```

---

## 4. Payment & Subscription Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant UI as UI Service
    participant API as API Server
    participant RZP as Razorpay
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Encrypt as Encryption Service

    User->>UI: Select Pro Plan
    UI->>API: POST /api/payment/create-order
    API->>RZP: Create Order
    RZP-->>API: Order ID & Details
    API-->>UI: Order Information
    UI-->>User: Show Razorpay Checkout
    User->>RZP: Complete Payment
    RZP->>API: Payment Webhook
    API->>API: Verify Signature
    API->>DB: Update User Subscription
    API->>DB: Update Token Quota
    API->>Encrypt: Encrypt Payment Details
    API->>DB: Store Transaction
    API-->>User: Confirmation Email
```

---

## 5. GitHub App Installation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant API as API Server
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>GH: Install Peer GitHub App
    GH->>API: Installation Webhook
    API->>API: Verify Signature
    API->>DB: Create Installation Record
    API->>GH: Request Installation Token
    GH-->>API: Installation Token
    API->>DB: Store Token (Encrypted)
    API->>GH: Get Repository List
    GH-->>API: Repositories
    API->>DB: Store Repository Config
    API-->>User: Installation Success
```

---

## 6. Database Schema (ERD)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ PRRun : creates
    User ||--o{ Installation : owns
    User ||--o{ PatchRequest : requests
    User ||--o{ Notification : receives
    Installation ||--o{ PRRun : triggers
    PRRun ||--o{ PatchRequest : generates
    
    User {
        ObjectId _id
        string githubId
        string username
        string email
        string avatarUrl
        string subscription
        number tokenQuota
        number tokensUsed
        date subscriptionExpiry
        object customApiKeys
        date createdAt
    }
    
    PRRun {
        ObjectId _id
        ObjectId userId
        ObjectId installationId
        string repoFullName
        number prNumber
        string status
        array findings
        object stats
        string llmProvider
        number tokensUsed
        date createdAt
    }
    
    Installation {
        ObjectId _id
        ObjectId userId
        number installationId
        string accountLogin
        array repositories
        object permissions
        string mode
        boolean autoMerge
        date createdAt
    }
    
    PatchRequest {
        ObjectId _id
        ObjectId userId
        ObjectId prRunId
        string status
        string fixBranch
        number fixPrNumber
        array filesChanged
        string llmReasoning
        date createdAt
    }
    
    Notification {
        ObjectId _id
        ObjectId userId
        string type
        string message
        boolean read
        date createdAt
    }
```

