## 12. Complete End-to-End PR Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    START([Developer Creates PR]) --> GH_EVENT[GitHub PR Event Triggered]
    
    GH_EVENT --> WH_RECEIVE[API: Receive Webhook]
    WH_RECEIVE --> WH_VERIFY{Verify Webhook<br/>Signature?}
    WH_VERIFY -->|Invalid| WH_REJECT[Reject Request]
    WH_VERIFY -->|Valid| WH_ACCEPT[Accept Webhook]
    
    WH_ACCEPT --> CHECK_INST{GitHub App<br/>Installed?}
    CHECK_INST -->|No| INST_ERROR[Return Error]
    CHECK_INST -->|Yes| GET_INST[Fetch Installation Details]
    
    GET_INST --> CHECK_USER{User Exists<br/>in DB?}
    CHECK_USER -->|No| CREATE_USER[Create User Record]
    CHECK_USER -->|Yes| FETCH_USER[Fetch User Data]
    
    CREATE_USER --> CHECK_QUOTA
    FETCH_USER --> CHECK_QUOTA{Check Token<br/>Quota}
    
    CHECK_QUOTA -->|Exceeded| QUOTA_ERROR[Send Quota Exceeded Email]
    CHECK_QUOTA -->|Available| CREATE_RUN[Create PRRun Record]
    
    CREATE_RUN --> GEN_TOKEN[Generate Installation Token]
    GEN_TOKEN --> ENQUEUE[Enqueue Analysis Job to Redis]
    ENQUEUE --> RESPOND[Return 200 OK to GitHub]
    
    RESPOND --> QUEUE_WAIT[Job Waits in Queue]
    QUEUE_WAIT --> WORKER_PICK[Analyzer Worker Picks Job]
    
    WORKER_PICK --> CLONE[Clone Repository]
    CLONE --> CLONE_CHECK{Clone<br/>Success?}
    CLONE_CHECK -->|Failed| CLONE_ERROR[Mark Run as Failed]
    CLONE_CHECK -->|Success| DETECT_LANG[Detect Languages in PR Files]
    
    DETECT_LANG --> PARALLEL_ANALYSIS[Run Parallel Analysis]
    
    subgraph "Parallel Static Analysis"
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> ESLINT[ESLint for JS/TS]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> SEMGREP[Semgrep Multi-Language]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> BANDIT[Bandit for Python]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> PMD[PMD for Java]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> CHECKOV[Checkov for IaC]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> HADOLINT[Hadolint for Docker]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> NPMAUDIT[npm audit]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> COMPLEXITY[Complexity Analysis]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> SECURITY[Security Pattern Scan]
        PARALLEL_ANALYSIS --> STYLE[Style Checker]
    end
    
    ESLINT --> AGGREGATE
    SEMGREP --> AGGREGATE
    BANDIT --> AGGREGATE
    PMD --> AGGREGATE
    CHECKOV --> AGGREGATE
    HADOLINT --> AGGREGATE
    NPMAUDIT --> AGGREGATE
    COMPLEXITY --> AGGREGATE
    SECURITY --> AGGREGATE
    STYLE --> AGGREGATE
    
    AGGREGATE[Aggregate All Findings] --> CATEGORIZE[Categorize by Severity]
    CATEGORIZE --> SAVE_DB[Save Findings to MongoDB]
    
    SAVE_DB --> GEN_REPORT[Generate Report]
    GEN_REPORT --> POST_COMMENT[Post PR Comment with Summary]
    POST_COMMENT --> SEND_EMAIL1[Send Analysis Complete Email]
    
    SEND_EMAIL1 --> CHECK_MODE{Autofix<br/>Mode Enabled?}
    CHECK_MODE -->|comment-only| END1([End: Comment Only])
    CHECK_MODE -->|commit/merge| CHECK_FINDINGS{Critical/High<br/>Findings Exist?}
    
    CHECK_FINDINGS -->|No| END2([End: No Fixes Needed])
    CHECK_FINDINGS -->|Yes| ENQUEUE_FIX[Enqueue Autofix Job]
    
    ENQUEUE_FIX --> FIX_QUEUE[Job in Autofix Queue]
    FIX_QUEUE --> FIX_WORKER[Autofix Worker Picks Job]
    
    FIX_WORKER --> FETCH_FINDINGS[Fetch Findings from DB]
    FETCH_FINDINGS --> GROUP_FINDINGS[Group Findings by File]
    
    GROUP_FINDINGS --> ITERATE_FILES[For Each File with Issues]
    ITERATE_FILES --> READ_FILE[Read Original File Content]
    READ_FILE --> BUILD_CONTEXT[Build AI Context with Findings]
    
    BUILD_CONTEXT --> SELECT_LLM{Select LLM<br/>Provider}
    
    subgraph "LLM Provider Selection"
        SELECT_LLM --> TRY_GROQ[Try Groq API]
        TRY_GROQ --> GROQ_CHECK{Groq<br/>Success?}
        GROQ_CHECK -->|Yes| LLM_RESPONSE
        GROQ_CHECK -->|No| TRY_GEMINI[Fallback: Try Gemini]
        
        TRY_GEMINI --> GEMINI_CHECK{Gemini<br/>Success?}
        GEMINI_CHECK -->|Yes| LLM_RESPONSE
        GEMINI_CHECK -->|No| TRY_OPENAI[Fallback: Try OpenAI]
        
        TRY_OPENAI --> OPENAI_CHECK{OpenAI<br/>Success?}
        OPENAI_CHECK -->|Yes| LLM_RESPONSE
        OPENAI_CHECK -->|No| TRY_OPENROUTER[Fallback: Try OpenRouter]
        
        TRY_OPENROUTER --> ROUTER_CHECK{OpenRouter<br/>Success?}
        ROUTER_CHECK -->|Yes| LLM_RESPONSE
        ROUTER_CHECK -->|No| LLM_FAILED[All Providers Failed]
    end
    
    LLM_RESPONSE[Receive Fixed Code] --> CACHE_RESPONSE[Cache LLM Response in Redis]
    CACHE_RESPONSE --> VALIDATE_SYNTAX{Syntax<br/>Valid?}
    
    VALIDATE_SYNTAX -->|Invalid| RETRY_LLM{Retry<br/>Count < 3?}
    RETRY_LLM -->|Yes| BUILD_CONTEXT
    RETRY_LLM -->|No| SKIP_FILE[Skip This File]
    
    VALIDATE_SYNTAX -->|Valid| COLLECT_FIX[Add to Fixed Files Collection]
    COLLECT_FIX --> MORE_FILES{More Files<br/>to Fix?}
    
    MORE_FILES -->|Yes| ITERATE_FILES
    MORE_FILES -->|No| CHECK_FIXES{Any Files<br/>Fixed?}
    
    CHECK_FIXES -->|No| END3([End: No Valid Fixes])
    CHECK_FIXES -->|Yes| CREATE_BRANCH[Create Fix Branch]
    
    CREATE_BRANCH --> CHECKOUT[Checkout New Branch]
    CHECKOUT --> APPLY_CHANGES[Apply All File Changes]
    APPLY_CHANGES --> COMMIT[Commit Changes]
    
    COMMIT --> PUSH{Push to<br/>GitHub?}
    PUSH -->|Failed| PUSH_ERROR[Mark as Failed]
    PUSH -->|Success| CREATE_PR[Create Fix PR]
    
    CREATE_PR --> PR_CREATED[Fix PR Created Successfully]
    PR_CREATED --> UPDATE_DB[Update PatchRequest in DB]
    UPDATE_DB --> TRACK_TOKENS[Track Token Usage]
    TRACK_TOKENS --> DEDUCT_QUOTA[Deduct from User Quota]
    
    DEDUCT_QUOTA --> CHECK_AUTOMERGE{Auto-merge<br/>Enabled?}
    CHECK_AUTOMERGE -->|No| SEND_APPROVAL[Send Approval Request Email]
    CHECK_AUTOMERGE -->|Yes| WAIT_CHECKS[Wait for CI Checks]
    
    WAIT_CHECKS --> CHECKS_PASS{All Checks<br/>Passed?}
    CHECKS_PASS -->|No| SEND_APPROVAL
    CHECKS_PASS -->|Yes| MERGE_PR[Auto-merge Fix PR]
    
    MERGE_PR --> CLOSE_ORIG[Add Comment to Original PR]
    CLOSE_ORIG --> SEND_SUCCESS[Send Success Email]
    SEND_APPROVAL --> SEND_SUCCESS
    
    SEND_SUCCESS --> UPDATE_STATS[Update User Statistics]
    UPDATE_STATS --> NOTIFY_GH[Update GitHub Status Check]
    NOTIFY_GH --> END_SUCCESS([End: Complete Success])
    
    LLM_FAILED --> END4([End: LLM Failure])
    CLONE_ERROR --> END4
    PUSH_ERROR --> END4
    
    style START fill:#4CAF50
    style END_SUCCESS fill:#4CAF50
    style END1 fill:#2196F3
    style END2 fill:#2196F3
    style END3 fill:#FF9800
    style END4 fill:#F44336
    style PARALLEL_ANALYSIS fill:#9C27B0
    style SELECT_LLM fill:#FF6F00
```

