## 15. Error Handling & Retry Mechanism

```mermaid
graph TB
    ERROR[Error Occurs] --> CLASSIFY{Error Type?}
    
    CLASSIFY -->|Network Error| NET_ERROR[Network Timeout/Connection]
    CLASSIFY -->|API Error| API_ERROR[API Rate Limit/Auth]
    CLASSIFY -->|Database Error| DB_ERROR[MongoDB Connection]
    CLASSIFY -->|LLM Error| LLM_ERROR[AI Provider Failure]
    CLASSIFY -->|GitHub Error| GH_ERROR[GitHub API Failure]
    
    NET_ERROR --> RETRY_NET{Retry<br/>Count < 3?}
    RETRY_NET -->|Yes| WAIT1[Exponential Backoff]
    WAIT1 --> RETRY_OPS[Retry Operation]
    RETRY_NET -->|No| LOG_FAIL
    
    API_ERROR --> CHECK_RATE{Rate<br/>Limit?}
    CHECK_RATE -->|Yes| WAIT_RESET[Wait for Reset]
    WAIT_RESET --> RETRY_OPS
    CHECK_RATE -->|No| CHECK_AUTH{Auth<br/>Error?}
    CHECK_AUTH -->|Yes| REFRESH_AUTH[Refresh Tokens]
    REFRESH_AUTH --> RETRY_OPS
    CHECK_AUTH -->|No| LOG_FAIL
    
    DB_ERROR --> RETRY_DB{Retry<br/>Count < 5?}
    RETRY_DB -->|Yes| WAIT2[Wait 2s]
    WAIT2 --> RECONNECT[Reconnect to DB]
    RECONNECT --> RETRY_OPS
    RETRY_DB -->|No| CRITICAL_ALERT[Send Critical Alert]
    
    LLM_ERROR --> FALLBACK_LLM[Try Next LLM Provider]
    FALLBACK_LLM --> CHECK_PROVIDERS{More Providers<br/>Available?}
    CHECK_PROVIDERS -->|Yes| RETRY_OPS
    CHECK_PROVIDERS -->|No| LOG_FAIL
    
    GH_ERROR --> RETRY_GH{Retry<br/>Count < 3?}
    RETRY_GH -->|Yes| WAIT3[Wait 5s]
    WAIT3 --> RETRY_OPS
    RETRY_GH -->|No| LOG_FAIL
    
    LOG_FAIL[Log Failure] --> UPDATE_STATUS[Update Job Status: Failed]
    UPDATE_STATUS --> SEND_NOTIF[Send Error Notification]
    SEND_NOTIF --> STORE_ERROR[Store in Error Collection]
    
    STORE_ERROR --> CHECK_CRITICAL{Critical<br/>Service?}
    CHECK_CRITICAL -->|Yes| ALERT_ADMIN[Alert Admin]
    CHECK_CRITICAL -->|No| END_ERROR([End: Error Handled])
    
    CRITICAL_ALERT --> ALERT_ADMIN
    ALERT_ADMIN --> ESCALATE[Escalate if Unresolved]
    ESCALATE --> END_ERROR
    
    RETRY_OPS --> SUCCESS{Operation<br/>Success?}
    SUCCESS -->|Yes| END_OK([End: Recovered])
    SUCCESS -->|No| ERROR
    
    style ERROR fill:#F44336
    style END_OK fill:#4CAF50
    style END_ERROR fill:#FF9800
    style CRITICAL_ALERT fill:#D32F2F
```

