## 16. Cache Management System

```mermaid
graph TB
    REQUEST[LLM Request] --> GEN_KEY[Generate Cache Key]
    GEN_KEY --> HASH[Hash: prompt + model + params]
    HASH --> CHECK_CACHE{Check Redis<br/>Cache}
    
    CHECK_CACHE -->|Hit| VERIFY_TTL{TTL<br/>Valid?}
    VERIFY_TTL -->|Yes| RETURN_CACHED[Return Cached Response]
    VERIFY_TTL -->|No| INVALIDATE[Invalidate Entry]
    
    CHECK_CACHE -->|Miss| CALL_LLM[Call LLM API]
    INVALIDATE --> CALL_LLM
    
    CALL_LLM --> LLM_RESPONSE[Get LLM Response]
    LLM_RESPONSE --> SAVE_CACHE[Save to Redis]
    
    SAVE_CACHE --> SET_TTL[Set TTL: 24 hours]
    SET_TTL --> TAG_ENTRY[Tag with Metadata]
    TAG_ENTRY --> RETURN_NEW[Return New Response]
    
    RETURN_CACHED --> LOG_HIT[Log Cache Hit]
    RETURN_NEW --> LOG_MISS[Log Cache Miss]
    
    LOG_HIT --> UPDATE_STATS
    LOG_MISS --> UPDATE_STATS[Update Cache Statistics]
    
    UPDATE_STATS --> SUCCESS([Success])
    
    subgraph "Cache Eviction (Background)"
        EVICT_CRON[Cron: Every Hour] --> SCAN_KEYS[Scan All Cache Keys]
        SCAN_KEYS --> CHECK_SIZE{Cache Size<br/>> Limit?}
        
        CHECK_SIZE -->|Yes| LRU[Evict LRU Entries]
        CHECK_SIZE -->|No| CHECK_EXPIRED
        
        LRU --> CHECK_EXPIRED{Expired<br/>Entries?}
        CHECK_EXPIRED -->|Yes| DELETE_EXP[Delete Expired]
        CHECK_EXPIRED -->|No| EVICT_DONE
        
        DELETE_EXP --> EVICT_DONE[Eviction Complete]
    end
    
    style REQUEST fill:#4CAF50
    style CHECK_CACHE fill:#FF6F00
    style SUCCESS fill:#4CAF50
    style EVICT_CRON fill:#2196F3
```

