## 17. Proposed: WebSocket Real-Time Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Client Layer"
        BROWSER[Browser Client]
        WS_CLIENT[WebSocket Client]
    end
    
    subgraph "WebSocket Gateway"
        WS_SERVER[Socket.IO Server]
        AUTH_WS[WebSocket Auth Middleware]
        ROOM_MGR[Room Manager]
    end
    
    subgraph "Event Bus"
        REDIS_PUBSUB[(Redis Pub/Sub)]
    end
    
    subgraph "Backend Services"
        API[API Service]
        WORKER_A[Analyzer Worker]
        WORKER_F[Autofix Worker]
    end
    
    BROWSER --> WS_CLIENT
    WS_CLIENT <--> WS_SERVER
    WS_SERVER --> AUTH_WS
    AUTH_WS --> ROOM_MGR
    
    ROOM_MGR <--> REDIS_PUBSUB
    
    API --> REDIS_PUBSUB
    WORKER_A --> REDIS_PUBSUB
    WORKER_F --> REDIS_PUBSUB
    
    REDIS_PUBSUB -->|Subscribe| ROOM_MGR
    ROOM_MGR -->|Broadcast| WS_SERVER
    WS_SERVER -->|Push| WS_CLIENT
    
    style WS_SERVER fill:#FF6F00
    style REDIS_PUBSUB fill:#D32F2F
```

